<!--
  Themed icon layer (Android 13+), flattened to a single wallpaper tint.

  The real mark is seven colour regions, and this layer has exactly one colour, so none of it
  survives: filled, the three prints would merge into one rounded blob. Outlines are the answer.
  Three overlapping rectangles drawn as strokes still read as three overlapping rectangles in any
  tint, because the information is carried by the edges rather than by the fills.
-->
